# Local build artifacts: keep them out of the image build context (the
# Containerfile's stages build their own copies;
# cmd/flue/flue-broker.bin is a go:embed source the flue build stage
# places there from the flue-broker stage, one per target platform).
# cmd/flue/flue-broker.sigstore is deliberately NOT excluded: it is a
# build-context input the flue build stage consumes — a release-signed
# or locally signed bundle, else its committed .placeholder fallback.
/flue
/flue-broker
/cmd/flue/flue-broker.bin
